      "change": "AC6-CHAIN-GEOMETRY-05 makes successor measurement consistent for all occupied bodies and same-pair LoE. AC6-N17 enumerates all ten bodies, every complete candidate array, fair draw, six actual saves and HP outcomes. The unsupported universal endpoint-center bound is removed."
